&lt;li&gt;Eligible to participate in HiveWatch Equity Incentive Plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Final offer will be at the company&#39;s sole discretion and determined by multiple factors, including years and depth of relevant experience and expertise, location, and other business considerations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
