&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sr. Product Marketing Manager, Partners&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Palo Alto, CA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Rubrik&#39;s first &lt;strong&gt;Sr. Product Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt; dedicated to Alliances &amp;amp; Partnerships, you will own the GTM narrative and field execution across our most strategic partner ecosystem, including Tier 1 partners like Microsoft, AWS, CrowdStrike, and Pure Storage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a single-product-line role. You are covering all of Rubrik, across cloud, security, and enterprise data protection, through the lens of our partner ecosystem. That means running multiple co-sell motions, joint solution stories, and partner GTM programs simultaneously, each with its own timeline, incentive structure, and go-to-market process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no playbook yet. You will write it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Narrative Excellence &amp;amp; Technical Depth&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate the Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Take complex, multi-vendor solution architectures and turn them into simple, urgent, and differentiated stories that cut through in a crowded market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master the Chess Board:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a relentless pulse on the competitive landscape across each partner category, cloud, security, and infrastructure. Keep our positioning steps ahead of market shifts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Boardroom to Basement:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop joint positioning and messaging for co-sell and partner-led motions that hold up in the field. Technically credible and executive-ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Field Enablement &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute High-Velocity Launches:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead high-impact joint launches, from solution announcements to partner event activations, that generate real pipeline and market momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the &quot;Win&quot; Engine:&lt;/strong&gt; Create the sales tools, partner playbooks, and competitive battlecards that equip both Rubrik&#39;s field and partner sales teams to win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fuel the Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Demand Gen and partner marketing teams to build co-branded campaigns that go beyond awareness and drive measurable conversion and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cross-Functional Orchestration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the Connective Tissue:&lt;/strong&gt; Build alignment across internal GTM teams and external partner organizations. Translate priorities, bridge timelines, and drive toward shared outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate Complexity:&lt;/strong&gt; Align stakeholders who move at different speeds, operate under different incentives, and measure success differently, without losing momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prioritize to Win:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify the highest-leverage opportunities across the partner portfolio and sequence them to drive near-term wins while building long-term infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years of product marketing experience in a high-growth B2B technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ecosystem Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience operating within large, matrixed organizations or partner ecosystems, such as a major cloud provider, large-scale ISV, or a company with significant channel and alliance infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Storytelling:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven ability to take multi-vendor, technically complex solutions and turn them into a crisp, differentiated narrative that resonates with both technical practitioners and C-Suite executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of owning end-to-end GTM motions, from positioning through launch to field enablement, with measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Growth Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; High ownership and high adaptability. You thrive in ambiguous, fast-moving environments and have a track record of building structure where none existed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We empower our teams to do transformative work. Here&#39;s why exceptional talent chooses us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Something That Lasts: &lt;/strong&gt;This is a chance to stand up a function, not fill a seat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unmatched Scope:&lt;/strong&gt; Visibility across all of Rubrik&#39;s GTM motions, not just one team or one product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Partners:&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly with Microsoft, AWS, CrowdStrike, Pure Storage, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trusted Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Thrive under visionary leaders who are invested in your personal and professional trajectory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Join a company at the forefront of Cyber Resilience, where the market is growing and the mission matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The minimum and maximum base salaries for this role are posted below; additionally, the role is eligible for bonus potential, equity and benefits. The range displayed reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire salaries for the role based on U.S. location. Within the range, the salary offered will be determined by work location and additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$185,700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$278,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
